// Local development workspace.
//
// The ASPEED AST2700 arm64 SoC/board support currently lives in the root
// TamaGo fork (../tamago) and is not yet upstreamed. Until it lands, redirect
// tamago to that fork via this workspace. This file shadows the root
// kyanite/go.work for any build run from within cairn/.
//
// Dagger builds construct their own go.work in-container and ignore this file.
//
// The go directive here matches the tamago-go compiler; the workspace go
// version must be >= every member module. The cairn module itself (go.mod)
// targets 1.27.
go 1.27

use (
	.
	../aspeed-go
	../core
	../lneto
	../nats-server
	../scree
	../tamago
)

// scree's go.mod requires github.com/nats-io/nats-server/v2 (for its JetStream
// adapter). Listing ../nats-server here satisfies that module-graph requirement
// locally; nats-server is not compiled unless imported.
